<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-620] Update cassandra-spark-1.5 profile to use Guava 16.0.1 and connector 1.5.0-RC1</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-620</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Right now, the Maven profile &lt;b&gt;cassandra-spark-1.5&lt;/b&gt; is broken because an older version of Guava is used (&lt;b&gt;15.0&lt;/b&gt; to be exact). This PR addresses this issue and also update the version of the Spark/Cassandra connector:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Guava version set to &lt;b&gt;16.0.1&lt;/b&gt; because the spark-cassandra connector is pulling the Java driver &lt;b&gt;3.0.0-rc1&lt;/b&gt; which requires Guava 16.0.1&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;spark-cassandra connector set to &lt;b&gt;1.5.0-RC1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Related PR: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/657&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/657&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
