                            <comment id="15106677" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 19 Jan 2016 12:56:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user doanduyhai opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/657&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/657&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Update cassandra-spark-1.5 profile to use Guava 16.0.1 and connector 1.5.0-RC1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    Right now, the Maven profile *&lt;b&gt;cassandra-spark-1.5&lt;/b&gt;* is broken because an older version of Guava is used (*&lt;b&gt;15.0&lt;/b&gt;* to be exact). This PR addresses this issue and also update the version of the Spark/Cassandra connector:&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Guava version set to *&lt;b&gt;16.0.1&lt;/b&gt;* because the spark-cassandra connector is pulling the Java driver *&lt;b&gt;3.0.0-rc1&lt;/b&gt;* which requires Guava 16.0.1&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;spark-cassandra connector set to *&lt;b&gt;1.5.0-RC1&lt;/b&gt;*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What type of PR is it?&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Bug Fix&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
